<title>POLAND: ANIMEX OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ANIMEX OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.09 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.39 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.43 vs   1.41</p>
<p> Sales		   57.67 vs  59.94</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    13.24 vs   9.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	18.63 vs  11.08</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.34 vs  18.75</p>
<p> Sales		  390.67 vs 441.38</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Animex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
